ion that's not really a defense in  my ID and you have to draw the line  somewhere and where you draw that line  depends on the evidence that people have  put forward right you have to weigh that  and think critically about it so just  remember this report now when you hear  people haphazard haphazardly and sort of  in a blanket way say there was no way  that Russia did this there's no reason  to believe Russia did this well Russia  did the exact same thing they have a  decades-long track record of doing send  me your thoughts I'm on Twitter at D  Pakman the show is on Twitter at David  Pakman show it's the Friday show

